<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK CUTS BANK SAVINGS CERTIFICATES RATES.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK CUTS BANK SAVINGS CERTIFICATES RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank </p>
<p>said on Monday it would cut interest rates on some of its bank</p>
<p>savings certificates from Tuesday January 21.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    three years     3.65 pct	3.80</p>
<p>    five years	4.60 pct	4.70</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
